  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We are Quote My Wall - The UK's number one shop for all things' vinyl - from wall stickers, to vinyl furniture wraps, to prints and window films. We provide affordable products, to transform your homes on a budget. Achieve amazing results with our stunning, high-quality vinyl product ranges.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">All our products are hand-made to order, in our London workshop. We take pride in producing each and every order, for our wonderful customers.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We pay all affiliates 10%, via PayPal in set agreed times. Earn money by spreading the word of our amazing small business brand, and allow people to bring colour into their homes, new leases of life into plain and old furniture, and beautiful decor into their rooms, without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n</div>",
